<%- include('../partials/top') %>

<div class="container" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,44px)">
  <p class="klabel" style="margin-bottom:8px">Admin console — first factor passed</p>
  <h2 style="font:600 1.9rem/1.15 var(--fd);color:var(--ink)">Two-factor verification</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="max-width:560px;margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7">
    Open your authenticator app and enter the current 6-digit code for <b>FirmLedger — admin</b>.
    If the app is unreachable, we've emailed a <b>one-time 6-digit code</b> (10-min expiry) to your
    admin email address — or use one of your unused <b>recovery codes</b> (works once each).
  </p>
</div>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-err"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <% if (ok) { %><div class="alert alert-ok"><%= ok %></div><% } %>
    <div class="form-card">
      <form method="post" action="/admin3119Musa/2fa" class="form">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= pendingCsrf %>">
        <label><span>Authenticator or recovery code</span>
          <input type="text" name="code" pattern="[0-9]{6}|[0-9A-Za-z]{4}-[0-9A-Za-z]{4}-[0-9A-Za-z]{4}" maxlength="14" minlength="6" required autocomplete="one-time-code" autofocus placeholder="123456 or XXXX-XXXX-XXXX">
        </label>
        <div class="form-actions" style="align-items:center">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" type="submit">Open console</button>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/admin3119Musa">Back</a>
        </div>
      </form>
      <form method="post" action="/admin3119Musa/2fa/resend" style="margin-top:14px">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= pendingCsrf %>">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" type="submit">Email me a fresh one-time code</button>
      </form>
      <p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:8px">The fresh code goes to the admin inbox · replaces the last code · one email per minute.</p>
      <p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:16px">After 5 wrong attempts the two-factor session is discarded and you re-enter the admin code — this is normal. Fully locked out (no app, no recovery codes)? Wipe the second factor from the database (<code>data/firmledger.db</code>): <code>DELETE FROM settings WHERE key='admin_totp_secret';</code> — the next sign-in re-enrolls a fresh key and new recovery codes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/bottom') %>
